# Allow-list: the image needs only what docker/Dockerfile COPYs. Everything
# else (worktrees, datasets, caches, model outputs) stays out of the build
# context, which is otherwise tens of GB.
*
!docker/requirements.txt
!docker/server.py
!packages/finetune/src/finetune/
!data/datasets/raw/gold_examples.json
**/__pycache__
